  PostgreSQL indexes represented by notes because DBML cannot preserve their predicate, expression, or advanced definition exactly:
  - external_access_tokens_credential_live_idx: CREATE INDEX external_access_tokens_credential_live_idx ON public.external_access_tokens USING btree (api_client_credential_id) WHERE (revoked_at IS NULL)
  '''
}

Table api_client_management_audit {
  id uuid [pk, not null, default: `gen_random_uuid()`]
  api_client_id uuid [not null]
  actor_staff_user_id uuid [not null]
  action text [not null]
  before_state jsonb
  after_state jsonb [not null]
  created_at timestamptz [not null, default: `now()`]
  credential_id uuid

  indexes {
    (api_client_id, created_at, id) [name: 'api_client_management_audit_client_idx']
  }

  Note: '''
  Role: Append-only external API management audit.
  Credential-linked actions use credential_id; ordinary client-management actions leave it NULL.
  PostgreSQL CHECK constraints:
  - api_client_management_audit_action_check: CHECK (action = ANY (ARRAY['CLIENT_CREATED'::text, 'CLIENT_METADATA_UPDATED'::text, 'CLIENT_SCOPES_UPDATED'::text, 'CLIENT_ACTIVATED'::text, 'CLIENT_SUSPENDED'::text, 'CLIENT_REVOKED'::text, 'CREDENTIAL_ISSUED'::text, 'CREDENTIAL_REVOKED'::text]))
  - api_client_management_audit_credential_context_check: CHECK ((action = ANY (ARRAY['CREDENTIAL_ISSUED'::text, 'CREDENTIAL_REVOKED'::text])) AND credential_id IS NOT NULL OR (action <> ALL (ARRAY['CREDENTIAL_ISSUED'::text, 'CREDENTIAL_REVOKED'::text])) AND credential_id IS NULL)
  PostgreSQL indexes represented by notes because DBML cannot preserve their predicate, expression, or advanced definition exactly:
  - api_client_management_audit_client_idx: CREATE INDEX api_client_management_audit_client_idx ON public.api_client_management_audit USING btree (api_client_id, created_at DESC, id DESC)
  - api_client_management_audit_credential_idx: CREATE INDEX api_client_management_audit_credential_idx ON public.api_client_management_audit USING btree (credential_id, created_at DESC, id DESC) WHERE (credential_id IS NOT NULL)
  '''
}

